灵山与江州  Vulture Peak to Jiangzhou  region 1 of 24 · tribulations 1–4
  语法关 Grammar gate: 把 bǎ · round 1 of 5
  把 brings the object before the verb to say what is done to it: subject 把
  object verb + result.
  例 请把门关上。
     Please close the door.
  例 他把作业做完了。
     He finished his homework.

  Lay the tiles in order: The monks swept the temple very clean.
  → 打扫得
  1 打扫得  2 寺庙  3 和尚们  4 把  5 很干净

  1-9 lay a tile · backspace undo · esc leave